# Amnesic Pi Stage 1 Tor configuration
ClientOnly 1
RunAsDaemon 1

# SOCKS is intentionally host-local. Transparent listeners accept packets
# redirected from the downstream interface; nftables restricts which ingress
# interface may reach them.
SocksPort 127.0.0.1:9050 IsolateSOCKSAuth
TransPort 0.0.0.0:9040 IsolateClientAddr IsolateClientProtocol
DNSPort 0.0.0.0:5353 IsolateClientAddr

AutomapHostsOnResolve 1
AutomapHostsSuffixes .onion,.exit
VirtualAddrNetworkIPv4 10.192.0.0/10

SafeSocks 1
TestSocks 1
ClientRejectInternalAddresses 1
ClientDNSRejectInternalAddresses 1

Log notice syslog
